{"kind":"report","text":"Checker review of plan 032 draft 3 at head 5fad8f08f247aa3244e70e6400c29bbb92392192, tree daeecb61, for request 37d78b0e and review request 446c778f. Verdict: CHANGES REQUESTED, for two small corrections.\n\nI read the diff from main, then checked its status facts against main, the workroom and the notes it cites. The plan now describes the journey correctly. The citations resolve: J3 at 06e4d33f, its follow-up 41da9810, the evidence-rules slice 9e313eff, J4 at 5dc9765f, the views design 92bedfda with df806354, the card kit 6e309b6b, M1's three landings, and the Git host note 053c5595. The order matches act a249511f, and the MVP slices' states match the acts.\n\n## Changes requested\n\n1. Decision 2 in section 2f can't be followed as written.\n   - It says the `finding` slice \"Lands as its own slice at J3's position, after the grow room's G4.\" That wording comes from the survey note of 26 October (`notes/2026-10-26-agentic-development-practice-survey.md:284-287`, at c81b168d), when the builder was on G4 and J3 was still ahead.\n   - J3 landed on 28 October, as this draft says in section 2b, so its position has passed. The order act a249511f, which section 2 calls the order from J4 onward, doesn't list a `finding` slice.\n   - Fix: say where the slice goes now, or say that it isn't filed and not yet in the order, with the question it waits on.\n\n2. Section 7 omits one change.\n   - The request asks section 7 to list every change from draft 2. Section 3's row 2 changes to \"2b: J5 with the agent wake; notification next\" (line 285), and section 7 has no entry for section 3.\n   - Fix: add the entry. The other changes I compared are all listed. The rewrap in section 2a changes no words.\n\n## Checks at this head\n\n- The worktree is clean. `git merge-tree --write-tree` onto main e3cb9fa8 gives the head tree daeecb61, and the head changes only the plan.\n- No prose line exceeds 79 characters.\n- check-doc-links on an export of the head: 761 links, 0 broken.\n- check-notes from 5dc9765f: 0 warnings.\n- check-commit-messages from 5dc9765f: 1 checked, 0 flagged.\n\n## Points that do not block\n\n1. Section 2f rests on a note that hasn't landed. Request a455fdba reads awaiting-review, and c81b168d isn't on main. The section says so (\"in review at c81b168d\"), which is honest, but readers can't reach that note from main. Landing the note would settle this.\n2. Decision 4 says the membership version is \"Filed as a design now\". I found no filing that names it, so the sentence may mean \"to be filed\". The planner knows which it is.\n3. Section 2b says \"S8 and S9 follow J1\". In a249511f, several items sit between them, which section 2's summary already covers.\n4. The J4 paragraph records the state on the afternoon of 30 October, and it will go stale when the policy phase runs. That is the nature of a status paragraph.\n\n## Architecture\n\nThe plan keeps the journey first, separates the source landing from live acceptance, and adds the agent wake before the exit test. Approved.\n\n## Security\n\nThe plan changes no boundary. Its J4 status keeps \"land, deploy, then witness\", and it claims no live acceptance. Approved.\n\n## Simplification\n\nRemoving the historical dependency text makes the plan shorter to follow, and section 2f gathers the five decisions in one place. Approved.\n\n## Conclusions\n\n- Architecture: approved.\n- Security: approved.\n- Simplification: approved.\n- The request's checks: the state and the re-cut decisions match the record apart from item 1, line length holds and the documentation checks pass. Section 7 needs item 2.\n\nA corrected head can come back for a review of its diff from this head.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:fa9293add43e726b55991dff9d3e992b2c196df6","binding":"assigned","head":"5fad8f08f247aa3244e70e6400c29bbb92392192","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:dd68ccc04eecb5123debc382b780b6ce1d7d95f0\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:a9659a436a878f9f2462201e35a6b3ad169c3dfa\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:ab6bcb38ae9756339d6653b112a4831ecb6b6e1e","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}